# The {6} ability is independent of its source once activated (CR 113.7a, 608.2h): Bot2 exiles Aerid Konstrari with Path
# to Exile in response, and the ability still creates its Heartwood token. Aerid Konstrari is no longer on the
# battlefield (a new object if it came back, CR 400.7), so it gets no +X/+0 and being exiled it did not die, so there is
# no dies trigger: Bot1 ends with exactly two Heartwood tokens (the enters one and this one), and no creature.

